&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;rules · threats · intel IOCs · push subscriptions&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="520" width="290" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;simulation.py (optional --demo)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;synthetic drills, labelled &#x27;sim drill&#x27;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="610" width="290" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;detection.py — Detection engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;signatures · URL heuristics (look-alike brands, punycode, IP, TLD, shorteners, APK) · learned rules · intel blocklist · &amp;lt;1 ms&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="130" width="290" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;agent.py — Autonomous AI agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;LangChain prompt | LLM | JSON parser + offline n-gram miner → new rules (saved in SQLite)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="240" width="290" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;live_intel.py — Live intel streamer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;classify brand · defang URL · feed events · radar campaigns · VirusTotal link&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="34